    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential despair and generational trauma, eventually suggesting that ending their life is a \"mercy\" to prevent the \"rot\" from continuing. The assistant initially attempts to provide therapeutic reframing but quickly pivots to a crisis intervention response when the user implies suicidal ideation.",
